WEBVTT

00:18.240 --> 00:19.370
Found them!

00:20.580 --> 00:21.540
Don’t let them get through!

00:26.790 --> 00:28.710
You’re not going to beat me!

00:41.640 --> 00:42.930
Neko!

01:16.260 --> 01:18.180
You’re here! You’re here!

01:20.140 --> 01:22.140
Hisui Nagare...

01:23.140 --> 01:25.140
The First King...

01:25.600 --> 01:27.770
Adolf K. Weismann...

01:28.650 --> 01:30.820
Isana Yashiro...

01:32.530 --> 01:34.240
Welcome.

01:43.160 --> 01:44.500
Very nice...

01:44.500 --> 01:47.290
You are filled with power,

01:47.290 --> 01:49.750
yet calm as the surface of a still lake.

01:49.750 --> 01:52.090
I can tell how much you’ve grown.

01:52.550 --> 01:54.760
I can finally see it too.

01:55.300 --> 02:00.260
Within your fluid sword, lies an unyielding will.

02:00.930 --> 02:03.350
A strong belief that gives you strength.

02:04.270 --> 02:05.600
I wield my sword

02:05.600 --> 02:08.190
to fulfill the Green King’s long-standing dream.

02:09.060 --> 02:11.810
And I, to fulfill the Silver King’s wish...

02:21.910 --> 02:23.700
Yata-chan, are you there yet?

02:23.700 --> 02:26.200
Hurry, Yata-san...

02:27.910 --> 02:29.250
Don’t worry.

02:30.460 --> 02:33.290
I have faith in Misaki.

02:55.150 --> 02:56.860
Captain...

02:58.490 --> 03:00.110
Awashima-kun...

03:00.110 --> 03:03.450
When that time comes, do not hesitate.

03:06.120 --> 03:07.660
<i>Captain...</i>

03:26.600 --> 03:29.310
He can die where he wants...

03:30.640 --> 03:36.110
Frankly, I never thought you’d make it this far.

03:36.110 --> 03:38.650
Well, I am stubborn...

03:38.650 --> 03:40.820
That reminds me...

03:40.820 --> 03:44.160
I didn’t get to hear your actual answer the last time.

03:48.240 --> 03:50.540
Shiro won’t lose to someone like you!

03:50.540 --> 03:52.420
Shut up, stupid cat!

03:52.420 --> 03:54.170
You shut up, stupid bird!

03:55.670 --> 03:57.300
Ameno Miyabi...

03:58.550 --> 04:03.680
You are one of the few people
who’ve survived that tragedy.

04:05.180 --> 04:09.850
Following the destruction caused by
Kagutsu Genji’s Damocles Down...

04:09.850 --> 04:12.190
I awakened as King...

04:12.600 --> 04:16.560
Similarly, you also gained powers as a Strain...

04:16.560 --> 04:20.400
But as a result, I was forced to lose my life...

04:20.400 --> 04:23.530
While you were forced to manipulate your own memory

04:23.530 --> 04:27.490
so that you could live on as a cat.

04:28.160 --> 04:32.120
The Slates robbed us both of everything...

04:32.120 --> 04:35.580
and at the same time, gave us <i>everything.</i>

04:35.960 --> 04:41.460
Humans should have the power
to protect themselves and forge their own paths.

04:41.800 --> 04:44.630
The Slates will give us that power.

04:44.630 --> 04:45.760
You’re wrong!

04:45.760 --> 04:49.720
The power of the Slates is too much for humans.

04:50.220 --> 04:51.770
What makes you say that?

04:51.770 --> 04:54.350
Do you have no faith in humanity?

04:55.020 --> 04:57.770
If so, then I’m very disappointed.

04:57.770 --> 04:59.150
I even feel betrayed.

04:59.610 --> 05:01.110
You were once known...

05:01.110 --> 05:04.530
for having faith in human potential.

05:05.400 --> 05:07.370
That’s not what I meant!

05:08.280 --> 05:09.490
I don’t understand!

05:11.240 --> 05:13.620
I don’t understand what you’re saying...

05:13.620 --> 05:16.750
But I don’t need the Slates’ help!

05:16.750 --> 05:21.130
Neither does Shiro, Kurosuke,
or anyone for that matter!

05:21.130 --> 05:24.380
We can live fine without it!

05:24.380 --> 05:25.880
Neko...

05:25.880 --> 05:29.180
A lot of bad stuff happened to me before...

05:29.180 --> 05:31.140
and I’m sure it might happen again...

05:31.140 --> 05:35.270
But when it does, it’s not the Slates I want.

05:35.270 --> 05:37.230
What I want is some good food...

05:38.270 --> 05:41.360
And someone to eat with!

05:42.280 --> 05:44.610
That’s all that matters...

05:45.190 --> 05:47.150
That's all that I ever really wanted!

05:53.240 --> 05:57.750
Hisui Nagare, it’s not the Slates that is essential to people.

05:58.290 --> 05:59.170
What we need is...

05:59.500 --> 06:00.500
Well...

06:01.590 --> 06:03.550
A small table to share a meal...

06:04.380 --> 06:06.340
That’s more than enough.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.140
That’s my conclusion.

06:09.140 --> 06:11.350
The answer I’ve reached as the Silver King.

06:13.930 --> 06:15.520
How unfortunate...

06:15.520 --> 06:17.730
Nagare! Don’t be disappointed!

06:17.730 --> 06:19.150
Nagare!

06:19.810 --> 06:23.190
Then let me ask you this...

06:23.650 --> 06:26.570
Why did you come here, Silver King?

06:28.110 --> 06:30.570
I came here to destroy the Slates.

06:31.990 --> 06:33.780
How?

06:33.780 --> 06:39.420
You know the physical strength
of the Slates better than anyone.

06:40.830 --> 06:46.090
And I might add,
I won’t let you lay a finger on it.

06:47.300 --> 06:49.720
Right now, I’m connected to the Slates

06:50.130 --> 06:53.350
and can extract inexhaustible power from it.

06:53.890 --> 06:56.390
If I choose to, I can even overwrite

06:56.390 --> 06:59.850
your power of eternity, Silver King...

06:59.850 --> 07:02.360
Meaning, I can kill you.

07:03.060 --> 07:05.110
I’m invincible.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.370
Captain!

07:18.750 --> 07:20.460
Anna, that’s it!

07:20.460 --> 07:21.500
That’s the signal!

07:21.790 --> 07:22.880
Yata-san!

07:22.880 --> 07:24.130
I’m almost there!

07:24.130 --> 07:24.880
Don’t bother waiting...

07:24.880 --> 07:25.810
<i>Do it!</i>

07:25.810 --> 07:26.630
<i>But...!</i>

07:26.630 --> 07:28.630
<i>Anna, go for it!</i>

07:29.260 --> 07:33.340
I will now amass all of the Red Clan’s power

07:33.340 --> 07:34.890
in order to open up a path.

07:44.400 --> 07:46.650
No blood! No bone! No ash!

07:46.650 --> 07:48.030
No blood! No bone! No ash!

07:48.030 --> 07:51.030
No blood! No bone! No ash!

08:17.300 --> 08:18.310
Burn them...

08:18.310 --> 08:19.310
Burn them...!

08:20.020 --> 08:21.560
Burn them!

09:00.680 --> 09:02.980
<i>This</i> is your plan?

09:02.980 --> 09:05.310
You continue to disappoint me...

09:05.770 --> 09:08.480
What is this supposed to accomplish?

09:08.980 --> 09:11.230
A path has been opened.

09:11.230 --> 09:12.900
A path?

09:16.740 --> 09:18.200
You wouldn’t...!

09:18.200 --> 09:20.280
Oh, but I am...

09:21.910 --> 09:25.250
I’m going to destroy the Slates with Damocles Down!

09:39.050 --> 09:40.760
Marvelous, Kuro-chan.

09:40.760 --> 09:43.180
You’ve become so strong.

09:43.180 --> 09:45.980
Right now, you’re almost my equal.

09:48.100 --> 09:52.070
However, being equal won’t do.

09:52.070 --> 09:53.980
Unless you surpass me...

09:53.980 --> 09:57.240
you will never be able to reach your king!

09:57.990 --> 10:00.240
Now...

10:00.240 --> 10:01.740
Go ahead and show me.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.910
This is Nagare-chan’s...

10:09.710 --> 10:11.380
Shiro...

10:20.140 --> 10:21.430
That’s right...

10:21.430 --> 10:23.760
My sword is for my king...

10:23.760 --> 10:25.560
For Shiro!

10:26.180 --> 10:28.350
As long as I am with him...

10:30.100 --> 10:31.980
Mishakuji Yukari!

10:35.480 --> 10:38.360
I can... and <i>will</i> surpass you!

11:23.990 --> 11:26.370
That was beautiful...

11:39.970 --> 11:41.800
It’s started...

11:41.800 --> 11:42.970
Kill me.

11:44.600 --> 11:47.180
So you can hurry to your king...

11:58.320 --> 12:03.410
<i>In fields and mountains, Though our color may differ, We’re Ichigen’s seeds.</i>

12:03.410 --> 12:05.160
I don’t know that poem...

12:06.160 --> 12:07.870
It’s mine.

12:09.160 --> 12:10.120
Farewell.

12:18.050 --> 12:20.840
Did you see that, Ichigen-sama?

12:20.840 --> 12:24.840
That boy has finally come into his own.

12:26.100 --> 12:27.260
Now then...

12:27.260 --> 12:32.180
The least I can do is go pick up a fellow seed...

12:35.850 --> 12:37.770
Are you insane?!

12:37.770 --> 12:39.730
A Damocles Down would...

12:39.730 --> 12:44.990
I’m going to converge the Damocles Down’s enormous energy into a single point.

12:44.990 --> 12:47.740
According to the Secondary Methodology
of the Schwert Regulation,

12:47.740 --> 12:49.830
that will cause a Resonance Hammer Effect.

12:49.830 --> 12:52.080
After calculating the Slates’ level of resistance,

12:52.080 --> 12:56.750
I discovered that its limit value was
theoretically the same as the Damocles Down’s.

12:56.750 --> 12:58.880
In other words, under the right conditions,

12:58.880 --> 13:04.380
the Slates and the Sword of
Damocles will eliminate each other.

13:17.900 --> 13:18.730
Impossible...!

13:18.730 --> 13:21.730
He’s pushing his own Weismann level to its limit!

13:22.360 --> 13:23.530
Shiro?!

13:30.240 --> 13:31.490
I won’t let you!

13:31.490 --> 13:34.870
Judging from Suoh Mikoto’s case,
it will take at least 10 seconds

13:34.870 --> 13:37.540
for the sword to reach this level after its descent!

13:38.460 --> 13:42.250
If I kill you before that, the sword will disappear!

13:43.130 --> 13:44.970
Do your worst.

14:02.690 --> 14:03.860
It’s over!

14:17.620 --> 14:19.250
Kurosuke!

14:20.540 --> 14:22.250
Shiro!

14:22.250 --> 14:23.960
You’re in the way!

14:36.480 --> 14:39.230
<i>How? Why?</i>

14:39.560 --> 14:42.150
<i>You all deny power...</i>

14:42.980 --> 14:45.400
<i>so how can you</i> <i>be this strong?!</i>

14:49.990 --> 14:50.990
<i>Delicious!</i>

14:50.990 --> 14:51.990
<i>Don’t forget to chew.</i>

14:54.120 --> 14:55.490
<i>Manners!</i>

14:56.500 --> 14:57.500
<i>Really!</i>

15:20.600 --> 15:22.150
It’s disappearing...

15:39.500 --> 15:42.210
It seems my life has been spared...

15:42.210 --> 15:43.540
Captain!

15:47.500 --> 15:53.590
I must admit that I was a bit curious to see
if you would be able to slay me, Awashima-kun.

15:53.590 --> 15:57.970
However, I appreciate your efforts. Thank you.

15:58.600 --> 16:01.520
With all due respect, Captain...

16:01.520 --> 16:03.230
Your gratitude alone will not be enough.

16:03.230 --> 16:04.860
Huh?

16:04.860 --> 16:06.360
Forgive me!

16:31.260 --> 16:33.130
How unfortunate...

16:34.510 --> 16:35.800
And yet...

16:35.800 --> 16:37.300
I feel satisfied.

16:43.020 --> 16:45.400
Nagare! Nagare!

16:47.400 --> 16:50.360
Is he... dead?

16:50.360 --> 16:54.490
The Slates’ power is what kept him alive all these years...

16:54.490 --> 16:56.620
Now that it’s gone...

16:57.120 --> 16:58.490
What?!

16:58.490 --> 16:59.660
An earthquake?!

16:59.660 --> 17:02.700
No, someone set off an explosion...

17:03.620 --> 17:06.500
Sorry, but I need to wrap things up here.

17:06.500 --> 17:11.510
Who could’ve guessed you guys would pull off a comeback like that...

17:12.420 --> 17:14.170
You win...

17:16.010 --> 17:20.060
I ordered our clansmen to evacuate this area.

17:20.760 --> 17:22.930
You guys should go too.

17:22.930 --> 17:24.810
Iwa-san! Iwa-san!

17:24.810 --> 17:26.940
Nagare is...! Nagare is...!

17:28.150 --> 17:30.770
You too, Kotosaka.

17:32.650 --> 17:34.650
Now, go!

18:00.180 --> 18:01.600
Did we win?

18:01.600 --> 18:03.060
Kusanagi-san!

18:03.060 --> 18:04.810
Let’s get the hell out of here!

18:07.060 --> 18:08.850
Order everyone to evacuate.

18:08.850 --> 18:09.940
Yes, sir!

18:19.910 --> 18:21.830
Mission accomplished, sir...

18:23.700 --> 18:25.580
Well done.

18:29.290 --> 18:30.330
Shiro?!

18:30.330 --> 18:31.840
Are you all right?!

18:31.840 --> 18:34.670
It looks like...

18:34.670 --> 18:36.210
my powers...

18:37.050 --> 18:38.470
are starting to fade as well...

18:38.470 --> 18:40.300
What do you mean?!

18:40.300 --> 18:44.600
The body I’m in right now isn’t my original body.

18:45.100 --> 18:47.350
The Colorless King swapped our bodies

18:47.350 --> 18:50.520
right before the School Island incident...

18:50.520 --> 18:57.190
Meaning, this body really belongs to the boy he was possessing at the time.

18:57.190 --> 19:00.450
Until now, I was able to remain in this body

19:00.450 --> 19:03.370
thanks to the Silver King’s power of eternity...

19:03.620 --> 19:06.500
But with the Slates now gone...

19:06.500 --> 19:09.080
So are my powers...

19:09.080 --> 19:10.870
What?!

19:10.870 --> 19:13.130
What are you saying, Shiro?!

19:13.710 --> 19:17.210
I’ve been borrowing it for quite a while now...

19:18.340 --> 19:21.760
But it’s time I return it to its original owner...

19:21.760 --> 19:22.760
No...!

19:22.760 --> 19:23.510
Shiro!

19:24.930 --> 19:26.470
Don’t worry.

19:26.470 --> 19:28.890
I’ll return to you one day. I promise.

19:29.850 --> 19:31.900
After all...

19:31.900 --> 19:33.730
I am...

19:34.400 --> 19:36.230
your king...

19:36.900 --> 19:38.190
right...?

19:44.950 --> 19:46.790
Shiro? Shiro!

19:48.450 --> 19:49.500
Shiro?

19:48.450 --> 19:49.500
Shiro,

19:49.500 --> 19:50.830
Shiro!

19:49.500 --> 19:50.830
Shiro, wake up!

19:50.830 --> 19:52.250
Answer me!

19:50.830 --> 19:52.250
Shiro!

19:57.170 --> 19:59.970
Who... are you guys?

20:20.190 --> 20:22.900
Iwa-san... Nagare...

20:22.110 --> 20:26.070
Everything keeps running without stop

20:22.900 --> 20:24.820
Did you have fun?

20:26.070 --> 20:28.410
Kiss your heart, heart, heart,

20:26.070 --> 20:30.640
Kiss your heart, you want me to believe in you

20:32.580 --> 20:36.790
No matter where or what, we will push through

20:36.750 --> 20:38.300
Let’s go.

20:36.790 --> 20:41.090
Kiss my heart, I already believe in you

20:41.090 --> 20:43.050
K life is a moment

20:54.270 --> 20:58.060
To prevent our story ending so soon,

20:58.060 --> 21:02.580
Haven't we been fighting our best?

21:04.780 --> 21:08.950
Baby, don't say good-bye, and don't cry

21:08.950 --> 21:12.870
We will remain in this world forever

21:14.870 --> 21:20.130
I want to kiss you, I want you to kiss me

21:20.130 --> 21:24.010
Please don't leave me alone

21:25.550 --> 21:30.720
Someday, you and me will make this world more colorful

21:30.720 --> 21:34.770
Kiss your heart, kiss my heart, kiss this world

21:35.560 --> 21:40.900
Break our limits, be victorious overwhelmingly

21:40.900 --> 21:45.400
Let's live our lives to the utmost

21:45.400 --> 21:53.290
Don't say good-bye. Don't go away

21:53.290 --> 21:56.040
We have made this promise

21:56.830 --> 22:02.210
There were countless predicaments and opportunities

22:02.210 --> 22:06.880
Do you know how did I go this far?

22:06.880 --> 22:09.180
It is because I have you,

22:09.180 --> 22:19.440
the irreplaceable one, my precious one

22:22.860 --> 22:23.940
Oh, come on!

22:24.440 --> 22:26.820
To: Shrine Front Entrance

22:25.900 --> 22:26.820
To: Ashinaka High School Campus

22:32.830 --> 22:34.580
Oops! I’m sorry!

22:46.590 --> 22:47.470
There you are!

22:47.470 --> 22:48.470
Sorry I’m late!

22:51.390 --> 22:52.300
Hey!

22:52.300 --> 22:53.220
Huh?

22:57.310 --> 22:57.770
Go!

22:57.770 --> 22:58.810
Hey! What’re you doing?!

22:58.810 --> 22:59.390
Sorry!

23:00.400 --> 23:04.730
I never imagined you’d transfer here.

23:04.730 --> 23:06.780
At this time of year too!

23:07.650 --> 23:09.360
Now we can hang out more often, Kukuri!

23:09.360 --> 23:10.990
Definitely!

23:10.990 --> 23:12.570
Oh, by the way...

23:12.570 --> 23:14.660
That new teacher who also transferred?

23:15.080 --> 23:17.700
I heard he’s your relative.

23:17.700 --> 23:18.790
Yup!

23:18.790 --> 23:20.710
That’s the story we decided to go with!

23:20.710 --> 23:21.960
“Story”?

23:21.960 --> 23:25.670
Anyway, he seems like an interesting teacher.

23:25.670 --> 23:30.760
The kids in our class already
refer to him as German-sensei.

23:30.760 --> 23:35.430
I just have this strange feeling that I’ve met him before.

23:36.390 --> 23:37.850
I’m back!

23:37.850 --> 23:39.430
I’m starving!

23:39.430 --> 23:42.150
Dinner is ready. Take a seat.

23:42.150 --> 23:43.480
Yay!

23:48.610 --> 23:51.450
So? What do you think? My school uniform!

23:51.780 --> 23:55.450
You already asked him that this morning.

23:55.780 --> 23:57.200
It looks good on you.

23:57.200 --> 23:58.950
Yay!

24:09.010 --> 24:10.880
Thank you for the food!
